     The mmaacc__sseett__ffdd(), mmaacc__sseett__ffiillee(), mmaacc__sseett__lliinnkk(), and mmaacc__sseett__pprroocc()
     functions return the value 0 if successful; otherwise the value -1 is re‐
     turned and the global variable _e_r_r_n_o is set to indicate the error.

